    "title": "Northern China Eatery Targeting Johns Creek For Third Location - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Emily McGinn ,\n13 hours ago Johns Creek mixed-use development Medley has tapped longtime Atlanta restaurant Northern China Eatery to bring its third location to the development, according to a release. This spot will be the third for the restaurant, which currently has its original location in Doraville and a second location in the Beltine, which opened last year. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
